    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0590" n="478" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg478"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Combs.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Repeat also to Quito.</p>
                <p>For your information and close study I quote the following protocol, which the
                    Department of State and the chargé d’affaires of the Argentine Repubhc and
                    Brazil will present in the three languages <pb facs="0591" n="479"
                        xml:id="pg479"/> probably within a week to the representatives of Ecuador
                    and Peru at Washington, who will be urged on behalf of the mediating powers to
                    sign it. Telegraph how, in your judgment, it will be received by the Government
                    and people of the country to which you are accredited.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d529-a1.xml" xpointer="d529-a1"/>
            </div>
